/forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/qkK5UH-NNozLoFnea8ZZ6rZ3ERGe3x8XMykPfT3tbSbkMPGn32zUw9zzDPvtltVOwe5XHD0RCf1Obq40uFiZrY4Gbnmc-EHQS-t3oWKnVUBznG6NgQm1wymzAQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/qkK5UH-NNozLoFnea8ZZ6rZ3ERGe3x8XMykPfT3tbSbkMPGn32zUw9zzDPvtltVOwe5XHD0RCf1Obq40uFiZrY4Gbnmc-EHQS-t3oWKnVUBznG6NgQm1wymzAQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/qkK5UH-NNozLoFnea8ZZ6rZ3ERGe3x8XMykPfT3tbSbkMPGn32zUw9zzDPvtltVOwe5XHD0RCf1Obq40uFiZrY4Gbnmc-EHQS-t3oWKnVUBznG6NgQm1wymzAQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> (It's also how they soulforge.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T15:38:13-07:00","id":151778,"title":"","content":"DeadGuy, have you been watching anything for Murdered: Soul Suspect? It's an upcoming video game about a detective in Salem who gets gunned down by a supernatural serial killer and is now trying to solve the case from the other side of the Shroud. It looks to me like Wraith with the number filed off in the best possible way, but I've seen very little hype for it. Just wanted to drop off the heads up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T19:50:01-07:00","id":152017,"title":"","content":"If you were to insert yourself on the game, how would be your character sheet. Realdeadguy?<br /> <br /> Is Michael jackson a Wraith or a Risen? <br /> <br /> will there be more data about stygia, the neighbourgs, the technology advancements you can find there etc...?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":". 05-29-2014, 10:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T18:33:31-07:00","id":153356,"title":"","content":"Has ectoplasm ever been written about in Wraith? It's a fundamental bit of most ghost stories.<br /> <br /> Will there be wordcount in the book devoted to chronicles set post-Sixth great Maelstrom?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T11:32:20-07:00","id":154058,"title":"","content":"@ atamajakki I think the post-Sixth great Maelstrom questions was answered already on the main Onyx Path site: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wraith-the-oblivion-20th-anniversary-edition/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/wraith-the-ob...rsary-edition/</a><br /> &quot;IanW<br /> August 23, 2013 at 7:56 am<br /> With our other 20th anniversary offerings, the setting has been moved to somewhere around the cusp of 2e and Revised. The end of the world is still coming, but it\u2019s not an immediate concern. I imagine our treatment of Wraith20 will similarly be pre-Maelstrom.&quot;<br /> <br /> This is something I am very glad about since I so want to get more of what we missed to fill out the original books! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Not to mention, I like the idea of leaving things open ended for the future giving players much more freedom in that regards.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1343-khaleesi","name":"Khaleesi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T15:12:00-07:00","id":155237,"title":"","content":"Michael Jackson is a Malfean.<br /> <br /> Next?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T20:10:10-07:00","id":155403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=155237#post155237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Michael Jackson is a Malfean. Next?</div> </div> </div> </div> Moonwalking Malfeans. Shudder to think I've always enjoyed the idea of masks in Stygian culture - is this something that will be expanded upon in Wr20? Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T13:15:35-07:00","id":160179,"title":"","content":"I own a Henry Higgenbotham original mask. Suffice to say I think masks are a big deal :-)<br /> <br /> Deadguy Out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:49:13-07:00","id":160413,"title":"","content":"important question: how you been realdeadguy? hows life treating ya","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T13:06:15-07:00","id":165065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=160413#post160413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">important question: how you been realdeadguy? hows life treating ya</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Doing well, thank you. This week, Rich Thomas and I agreed on the final iteration of the W20 outline and the chapter word count breakdowns, which means I can start kidnapping writers and locking them in my basement, errr, getting writers formally on board :-)<br /> <br /> (side note: I don't actually have a basement)<br /> <br /> <br /> Other than that, watching the news from E3 - for those of you who don't know, I'm working at Ubisoft, and so this time of year is kind of a big deal. Got some stories coming out in anthologies soon, and <br /> <br /> Going to have some interesting stuff to post shortly....<br /> <br /> Deadguy Out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T17:17:12-07:00","id":165400,"title":"","content":"Wait..youre working at Ubisoft?!...does that means that......holy shit....you will announce Half life episode 3?!<br /> <br /> So, which writters you got in mind? , which artists?.<br /> Also, any chances to see Necropolis on South America? (im chilean so...i always wondered how santiago de chile would be a necropolis with all the pinochet/allende stuff and the Cue De Gra)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T11:41:24-07:00","id":166130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=124322#post124322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you for saving me from making an &quot;All Dogs Go To Heaven&quot; joke. Y'all are probably too young for that, anyway.<br /> <br /> Just put the final touches on the outline of the Spectres chapter. So, yes, that's a thing. Risen I'm still futzing with. As opposed to the Riesen, which are the ghosts of chocolate caramel candies, which will appear in a later supplement.<br /> <br /> -Deadguy Out<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I have fond memories of this movie as a child. I am a dog person and I knew it was different from the other movies I was watching. Also, your sense of humor is right up my alley.<br /> <br /> It's good to see you back. Wraith was the second World of Darkness game I got into and is my second favorite as well. (Hunter is first in both regards.) I don't think I have read anything by Dansky and not liked it. I am more excited about this than I am about Ex3. That's saying something.<br /> <br /> I recommend the manga/anime Bleach as inspiration for Wraith. I don't know how many times I watched that show and something in my head screamed at me, &quot;That's SO Wraith!&quot;<br /> <br /> The only things I would like to see is a more streamlined shadowguiding process and people to actually give the game a chance before dismissing it as an exercise in frustration. Keep up the good fight, Deadguy.<br /> <br /> Oh, and I invoked the name of the Deadguy in a Hunter: the Reckoning thread on this same board. I am not sure what kind of terrible force that might have unleashed, but I was frustrated dangit! :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 06-11-2014, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T13:49:26-07:00","id":166210,"title":"","content":"Will there be example Heretic cults and Renegade gangs in the book?<br /> <br /> Can we expect information on the Fishers?<br /> <br /> Have you seen any gameplay footage of Murdered: Soul Suspect?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T17:21:25-07:00","id":166371,"title":"","content":"Hi RealDeadguy, I have some questions about the Shadowlands.<br /> <br /> 1 - What separates the Dark Kingdoms? The Sea of Shadows, The Sunless Sea or the Open Sea?<br /> 2 - What sea became permanently disturbed after the 3rd Maelstrom? The Sea opf Shadows, right?<br /> 3 - That sea of question #2 is somehow possible to swim into before 3rd Maelstrom?<br /> 4 - Is the same perception that we have on the beach (when we enter the water and it gets deeper as we go away from the shore) valid when on an island in the middle of a sea in Shadowland?<br /> 5 - Are all that seas inhabited by foul and nasty creatures as spectres and malfeans by that time (before 3rd Maelstrom)?<br /> 6 - When Charon arrived in Shadowlands it is said thar he found a powerful wraith already there. Would it be Abel?<br /> 7 - Is it said that the Shining Ones and other very powerful wraiths such the Deathlords or even Charon have same level of power and they seem to go of the scale of Arcanoi, that goes from 1 to 5. What other kind of power trait they could have?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3082,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3082-dfcastro","user":"dfcastro","date":".  Fixed question #5 and added #6 and #7 06-11-2014, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3082-dfcastro","name":"dfcastro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T20:27:20-07:00","id":166489,"title":"","content":"Is it possible to have a Haunt to exist in both in the Skinlands and the Shadowlands? Excluding graveyards and death highways.<br /> Examples: Pythian Castle, spent several years in disrepair inside until relatively recently when a person bought and restored it. And the Ray House, used as a field hospital during the Civil War, though majority of the artifacts are preserved there was a lot of life lost in that house.<br /> <br /> How would one incorporate a death highway?<br /> Example: Highway 13 between Humansville and Bolivar has the highest rate of accidents (good chunk fatal) in the state.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T20:41:26-07:00","id":166501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=166210#post166210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you seen any gameplay footage of Murdered: Soul Suspect?</div> </div> </div> </div><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy\">&quot;RealDeadguy</a></b><br /> <br /> 03-26-2014, 05:28 AM<br /> <br /> <br /> Wraith fans might want to check out the upcoming Murdered: Soul Suspect.&quot;<br /> <br /> I got a question about your personal backstory on the game. I dont mean on metaplot elements.<br /> Being completely and utterly serious, how you got so interested in ghosts? how did you conceved the story, the elements, the factions. Since every ghost story is different, since every ghost has different powers in different interpretations, how did you found the &quot;Common Grounds.&quot; and the basic Rules per say.<br /> <br /> Why Ghosts?<br /> <br /> And What can you say its the biggest inspiration for the game, any story that makes you say &quot;Thats the vision i had in mind when i worked on wraith?&quot;<br /> <br /> I was talking with a friend, he is very into werewolf the apocalypse (he runs it as if was a bit of God Of War per say) and he told me &quot;Why you liked Wraith SO much.&quot; i had to say &quot;because, its intimate and personal, the horror comes from within yourself and your own darkness. its not an outside force or a lovecraftian being, its you. youre the architect of your own damnation&quot;, would you say that wraith is a &quot;Personal Horror&quot; Game? or a game of &quot;Shattered Hope&quot; ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":". 06-12-2014, 12:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T11:40:37-07:00","id":167111,"title":"","content":"Hey, Deadguy, I almost forgot to ask, and since you mentioned outlining a chapter on Risen: are the issues with Risen using <i>Vampire</i> Disciplines being addressed? I don't know if you ever got eyes on it, but I whipped up something over in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/36196-wr20-risen-the-vampire-physical-disciplines\">this thread</a>.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T15:46:28-07:00","id":167298,"title":"","content":"Quick answers (there will be more later)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=166210#post166210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will there be example Heretic cults and Renegade gangs in the book?<br /> <br /> Can we expect information on the Fishers?<br /> <br /> Have you seen any gameplay footage of Murdered: Soul Suspect?</div> </div> </div> </div>1-Yes, there will be specific cults and gangs in the book. The Riders of the Wheel are still my peeps.<br /> 2-There should be some stuff on the Fishers. None of them named Sam, however.<br /> 3-I'm friends with Anna Megill, who was one of the writers on the project. If you're interested, you can check out an interview I did with her and former WW writer and current Alan Wake scribe Mikko Rautalahti over in Dark Discoveries magazine. (Seriously, those two reach ridiculous levels of awesomeness when you put them together. Also, they argue a lot about cheese.)<br /> <br /> Deadguy Out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T16:48:36-07:00","id":167348,"title":"","content":"Looking forward to more Riders info; they're a big part of my current chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T22:40:12-07:00","id":167586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote