o</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=189951#post189951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What happens to child Wraiths in the Shadowlands? <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ymZQRTHLkP0\" data-code=\"ymZQRTHLkP0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ymZQRTHLkP0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div> It says somewhere that most are soulforged or become Spectres; children lack the emotional maturity to resist Oblivion for long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T04:57:05-07:00","id":190144,"title":"","content":"Yeah most children either soulforged or succumbed to Spectredom, becoming the Stripling spectres. A few are able to resist their Shadows and escape the claws of the Hierarchy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:51:46-07:00","id":192115,"title":"","content":"Do you prefer my bs questions over my serious questions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T10:38:42-07:00","id":192513,"title":"","content":"Hi RealDeadguy!<br /> <br /> I'm so excited to hear about the progress with Wraith20 and that you are assigning writers. Will you be giving feedback and responses to all those who submitted for Wraith, even if its a thumbs down? I read that some of the developers were but its an individual deal. Would be great to know.<br /> <br /> Katrina","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2386-katrina","name":"Katrina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T21:07:27-07:00","id":193107,"title":"","content":"Right. Where was I?<br /> <br /> Had some great discussions with a few folks whose names you might recognize. More on that once I get signatures on dotted lines.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, I don't know if I'll have bandwidth to give feedback to everyone who's submitted, though I'll do my best. In my day job, I work for Ubisoft as a game writer, and as you may have heard, video game development tends to chew up as many hours as you'll let it. And of course, my priority has to be on getting the book done; we're rapidly running out of 2014. So if I can, I will, and if I can't, well, I'll be around here and you can try to prod me directly.<br /> <br /> There are no BS questions. Except ones about ashtrays.<br /> <br /> -Deadguy Out<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T21:21:56-07:00","id":193112,"title":"","content":"cue the ashtray jokes\u2026<br /> <br /> Seriously, my knowledge of <b>Wraith</b> isn\u2019t deep enough to ask any serious questions that haven\u2019t already been asked. Will Shadowguiding be kept? Answered. Will mediums and Risen be addressed? Answered. Will other Dark Kingdoms be addressed? I <i>think</i> that\u2019s been answered. Etc. <br /> <br /> At this point, I think my single biggest question is: aside from nostalgia, what is the single biggest reason why I should buy Wraith20?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40p