"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> And no, Wraith20 is not even on the list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Damn it all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T15:12:41-07:00","id":230605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katrina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=230576#post230576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OnyxPath just posted update for <b>Classic World of Darkness: Jan-Aug 2015</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/classic-world-of-darkness-jan-aug-2015/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/classic-world-of-darkness-jan-aug-2015/\" target=\"_blank\"> Classic World of Darkness: Jan-Aug 2015 &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/classic-world-of-darkness-jan-aug-2015/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/classic-world-of-darkness-jan-aug-2015/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> And no, Wraith20 is not even on the list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's because Wraith 20 is likely to come out in the Fall and the update only goes to <b>August 2015</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T23:31:31-07:00","id":231098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=230605#post230605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's because Wraith 20 is likely to come out in the Fall and the update only goes to <b>August 2015</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that Wraith20 was schedule for September 2014 until a few weeks ago, there's plenty of cause to be sad. We just watched a book get delayed by a year before our very eyes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T23:43:59-07:00","id":231106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=231098#post231098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Considering that Wraith20 was schedule for September 2014 until a few weeks ago, there's plenty of cause to be sad. We just watched a book get delayed by a year before our very eyes.</div> </div> </div> </div>It wasn't going to be out in September anyway - Deadguy only started contracting writers recently, and there was absolutely no way Wr20 was going to be produced in two months. There was going to be a delay, the question was how much.<br /> <br /> (Also see Mage20, which was initially scheduled for Autumn 2013. Best estimate now is December 2014.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T07:50:38-07:00","id":231501,"title":"","content":"I basically had mini-frenzy over my two favorite lines getting moved over, AGAIN. ;_;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T16:27:55-07:00","id":238661,"title":"","content":"I was just listening to &quot;Gen Con 2014 - What's Up With the Classic World of Darkness,&quot; posted by Onyx Path. Here is the link: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aL9D2_pGucY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aL9D2_pGucY</a><br /> <br /> There is a very brief mention of Wraith20 at 8:31 minutes in to 9:16. Paraphrased: In the Fall, currently last touches being done on the outline, writers being assigned and expect somekind of Kickstarter. Also, it was orginally released at Gen Con twenty years ago.<br /> <br /> Hope this helps! I feel you, Katrina and Atamajaki! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> We just need to hang in there together!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1343-khaleesi","name":"Khaleesi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T18:22:47-07:00","id":241883,"title":"","content":"hey, has anyone hear anything from Rich is he still alive..or dead..dunno..his profile name and his involvement in wraith confuses me as his state of being..if you read this rich, hows a going?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T23:40:36-07:00","id":242047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=241883#post241883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">hey, has anyone hear anything from Rich is he still alive..or dead..dunno..his profile name and his involvement in wraith confuses me as his state of being..if you read this rich, hows a going?</div> </div> </div> </div>He's outlined Wraith 20 and is contracting writers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T14:17:39-07:00","id":246362,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Hi there Deadguy (and other people too!)<br /> <br /> I've posted this to a few FB groups that deal with Wraith and/or WoD, and though this would be a good opportunity to (hopefully) get an answer from Deadguy himself on the topic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Of course, I'd be interested to hear anyone else's 2 cent on this too:<br /> <br /> ==<br /> This is just a little something that I was reminded of whilst remini</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">scing on with friends about previous WoD games we have run and/or played in - something I'd like other Wraith ST's and Players to give their 2 cents on (and which I'll be cross-posting on a couple of different FB groups, so you may see this more than once - so advanced apologies for any inconvenience) .<br /> <br /> Once upon a time, during a game I was running, we had a player whose character was framed for a murder he didn't commit, whose Shadow had the Dark Passion &quot;Kill the 'Twelve Good Men' (Revenge) &quot; who sent him to the Chair.<br /> <br /> During the course of the game (before it ended due to real life pressures), the Shadow had managed to arrange the death of at least *3* members of said Jury. It was only at this point that we had realised that there were no rules or guidelines in the game on what happens when a Shadow *succeeds* in Resolving a Dark Passion.<br /> <br /> My players and I (and a few posters from the ye olde Wraith List) came up with a few possible solutions (eg. All Dark Passion dots immediately convert to Permanent Angst dots; Dark Passion dots are converted to Thorn points/ Shadow Xp/ divided up amongst the remaining Dark Passions; and The Dark Passion's Focus expands or widens [eg. the family members and work mates of the jury members now become the targets of the Shadow's Revenge].<br /> <br /> Because the game ended, we never ended up deciding on an actual house rule on what to do *if* the Dark Passion ever got Resolved...so, I was just wondering if anyone ever encountered a similar situation in their games (and how they chose to deal with it), or just what anyone thinks *should* happen, in their opinion. Thanks in advance! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> ==</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This is the Line of Division...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3797-terminus-est","name":"Terminus Est","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3797_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T20:49:53-07:00","id":263372,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/webkit-fake-url://77B035E0-97EF-467F-A45D-1E6768E81B2D/tumblr_msoqmdWFPw1rawb5do1_500.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">I LIVE.</span><br /> <br /> Rounding up the last few writers I'm going to need. Discussing division of Arcanos assignments between two of my favorite people to work with. Writing contracts. Setting up PDFs of Wraith source materials for writer reference. Discussing the fine points of some of the changes being made with _____ _________. <br /> <br /> You know, the usual stuff.<br /> <br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br /> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T12:34:41-07:00","id":264029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=263372#post263372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Discussing the fine points of some of the changes being made with _____ _________.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Arcanoi Markings?<br /> Shadowguide Rules?<br /> Tempest Travel?<br /> Artifact Creation?<br /> Oboli Economics?<br /> Deathlord Toilets?<br /> Barghest Leashes?<br /> [Hierarchy/Renegade/Heretic] Status?<br /> Samuel Haight?<br /> Comfy Spork?<br /> [Passion/Fetter] Resolution?<br /> Spectre Genesis?<br /> Phil Collins?<br /> </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T21:44:09-07:00","id":265208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nazfool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=264029#post264029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Arcanoi Markings?<br /> Shadowguide Rules?<br /> Tempest Travel?<br /> Artifact Creation?<br /> Oboli Economics?<br /> Deathlord Toilets?<br /> Barghest Leashes?<br /> [Hierarchy/Renegade/Heretic] Status?<br /> Samuel Haight?<br /> Comfy Spork?<br /> [Passion/Fetter] Resolution?<br /> Spectre Genesis?<br /> Phil Collins?<br /> </span></div> </div> </div> </div>You know the rooms underneath Stygia filled with dozens and dozens of bottle Spectres that they're trying to convert back to wraith-hood?<br /> <br /> They play Phil Collins in those rooms.<br /> <br /> Nothing but Phil Collins.<br /> <br /> Late-period solo Phil Collins.<br /> <br /> Forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T23:39:19-07:00","id":265237,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">No wonder the Martyr Knights have such a lousy success rate...<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T16:45:52-07:00","id":265811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=265208#post265208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know the rooms underneath Stygia filled with dozens and dozens of bottle Spectres that they're trying to convert back to wraith-hood?<br /> <br /> They play Phil Collins in those rooms.<br /> <br /> Nothing but Phil Collins.<br /> <br /> Late-period solo Phil Collins.<br /> <br /> Forever.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that explains why the Orphan-Grinders didn't show up until after Stygia was wiped out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T19:22:40-07:00","id":265894,"title":"","content":"Wait...if you say I LIVE and youre a RealDeadMan...then....what are you? xD!<br /> <br /> hows a going, hows life treating ya? i wanted to know if you will expand on weaponry (from medieval from WWI, WWII and Modern) and how advances or what kind of tech you can find in the Underworld?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T20:15:23-07:00","id":265911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=265894#post265894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait...if you say I LIVE and youre a RealDeadMan...then....what are you? xD!<br /> <br /> hows a going, hows life treating ya? i wanted to know if you will expand on weaponry (from medieval from WWI, WWII and Modern) and how advances or what kind of tech you can find in the Underworld?</div> </div> </div> </div>Easy. I'm a Sinistar fan.<br /> <br /> And one of the things we're going to be focusing on is making sure the Systems and Drama material is very clearly Wraith-specific. So you won't get an endless list of polearms, but you will get more about how the specific circumstances of being wraith affects how you use stabby pointy things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T20:15:54-07:00","id":265913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nazfool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=265237#post265237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">No wonder the Martyr Knights have such a lousy success rate...<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></div> </div> </div> </div>No shit. I mean, really.<br /> <br /> And thank you for not making a Nickelback joke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T04:35:02-07:00","id":266082,"title":"","content":"also, will you elaborate a bit further on the relation between wraiths and other supernaturals?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T10:36:15-07:00","id":266293,"title":"","content":"Welcome back Living RealDeadguy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> In honor of your return: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0DuslOdI36I\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0DuslOdI36I</a><br /> <br /> A quick question and a comment.<br /> <br /> Q1. Will you be going back through this thread and answering questions that are still open and we are waiting breathlessly for?<br /> <br /> C1. I personally, hope the focus will be on wraiths, rather than on other supernaturals. I feel the others are have their coverage in their own lines, and any and all white space should be on Wraith since we are missing so much. Respectfully, IMHO. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Once again, Salute! To your return!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2386-katrina","name":"Katrina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T14:52:17-07:00","id":266439,"title":"","content":"I can't wait to see Wraith20 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I don't have a question (or, in fact, I have too many, so I can't choose what to ask), but I have a request: I wanna see more about all the Dark Kingdoms, not just Estygia or the Dark Kingdom of Jade. I'd love can read much more things about the Dark Kingdoms of Obsidian, about Swar, the Dark Kingdom of Clay or the Sea Which Knows No Sun. All of them. I loved Wraith's Players Guide specially thanks to this section. And I know that's ask too much for the rulebook, but well, it's what I'd really like to see, and I needed to say it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/n6g3njp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/kpa5GS5Mp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/93820aaad7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/584-eliseo-ap-liam","name":"Eliseo ap Liam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T07:25:19-07:00","id":266745,"title":"","content":"How do Wraiths respond or react to any Supernatural version of Necromancy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T10:25:53-07:00","id":266832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=266745#post266745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do Wraiths respond or react to any Supernatural version of Necromancy?</div> </div> </div> </div>Unhappily, I would think....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T23:40:48-07:00","id":267234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=266832#post266832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unhappily, I would think....</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends what the Necromancy is for, really. If it's more towards the Giovanni's wraith enslavement, they're not going to be happy. If it's more like the Hollow One rotes that help wraiths out (in their Tradition book), they're going to be more appreciative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T23:48:30-07:00","id":267237,"title":"","content":"if its any sort of necromancy involving Demon the fallen....Well....ermm...anyone seen the movie Book of Blood?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T10:48:03-07:00","id":267524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=267234#post267234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depends what the Necromancy is for, really. If it's more towards the Giovanni's wraith enslavement, they're not going to be happy. If it's more like the Hollow One rotes that help wraiths out (in their Tradition book), they're going to be more appreciative.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if it's helpful, it better be on the downlow.... The help might be nice, but it might not be worth it if it means becoming a doorstop if you get caught....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T12:04:16-07:00","id":267556,"title":"","content":"Will I be going back through the thread and picking up old questions? If time permits, absolutely. If I don't get to yours, don't hesitate to repost.<br /> Will the focus be on wraiths? Yes, a thousand times yes. There will be material on crossover games and relations to the rest of the WoD because, well, it's a /world/ of Darkness, but my focus has always been and will always be wraiths. The other guys have enough books; they don't get the bulk of the content in ours :-)<br /> Will there be material on the Dark Kingdoms? If you add up the word count devoted to the various Dark Kingdoms in the DKoJ books, Ends of Empire, the WPG and SPG, you end up with well over 150K words. I don't think I can get /all/ of that into Wraith 20 :-) But the Dark Kingdoms will not be ignored or forgotten, and if we have some success with W20, I'd love to dive deeper into them down the line.<br /> Why all the Phil Collins hatred? Personal reasons. Also, even mention the word &quot;Sussudio&quot; to me and I'm ear wormed for a week. Damnit.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T14:12:18-07:00","id":267672,"title":"","content":"Some basic rules questions:<br /> <br /> 1) Can a wraith soak aggravated damage with Stamina alone, or is some kind of Arcanoi or armor required?<br /> 2) Does Usury cause aggravated or lethal damage when taking health from another?<br /> 3) Does Castigate 5 require the Shadow to attempt Catharsis before activating the art?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3138-old-rusty-pipe","name":"Old Rusty Pipe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T17:01:28-07:00","id":267759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=267556#post267556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will there be material on the Dark Kingdoms? If you add up the word count devoted to the various Dark Kingdoms in the DKoJ books, Ends of Empire, the WPG and SPG, you end up with well over 150K words. I don't think I can get /all/ of that into Wraith 20 :-) But the Dark Kingdoms will not be ignored or forgotten, and if we have some success with W20, I'd love to dive deeper into them down the line.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure we'll get some more books to expand everything. A Shadowlands Atlas would be awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Another question about Wraith 20th rulebook: Will we get only the Estygian Arcanoi or will there be space for the all the others? And the powers of each Arcanos? Only the standard ones or the alternate ones from Guildbooks and supplements?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/n6g3njp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/kpa5GS5Mp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/93820aaad7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/584-eliseo-ap-liam","name":"Eliseo ap Liam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T23:38:34-07:00","id":268038,"title":"","content":"Since wraith its a pretty psycological game...how could you explain the Spectres existance from a psycology stand point, and how could you separate them from any other being of the WoD ( had this discussion with a friend who claimed that a Spectre could easly be mixed up with a Perdition from werewolf the apocalypse)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T23:45:25-07:00","id":268044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=266745#post266745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do Wraiths respond or react to any Supernatural version of Necromancy?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> By sitting on the hood of a classic muscle car and talking about their feelings, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T23:48:37-07:00","id":268048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=268038#post268038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since wraith its a pretty psycological game...how could you explain the Spectres existance from a psycology stand point, and how could you separate them from any other being of the WoD ( had this discussion with a friend who claimed that a Spectre could easly be mixed up with a Perdition from werewolf the apocalypse)</div> </div> </div> </div>Spectres are, at their base, human. They may have given in to Oblivion, but the raw material that Oblivion is working with is human - hate, fear, jealousy, despair, etc., all filtered through a particular human's experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T23:49:41-07:00","id":268049,"title":"","content":"And for the record, folks:<br /> <br /> Most of my answers are serious.<br /> <br /> A few...not so much.<br /> <br /> And sometimes when I don't answer a question, it's because I can't give you the answer...yet.<br /> <br /> Let the wild rumpus of speculation begin!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T08:54:07-07:00","id":268285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=268049#post268049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And for the record, folks:<br /> <br /> Most of my answers are serious.<br /> <br /> A few...not so much.<br /> <br /> And sometimes when I don't answer a question, it's because I can't give you the answer...yet.<br /> <br /> Let the wild rumpus of speculation begin!</div> </div> </div> </div>being a bit more serious, hows Halloween and Dia de los Muertos treated in wraith.?<br /> also, i was discussing with a friend about how...overkill wraith is (i mean as a pyschological game), and he claimed that not many players would go through wraith concidering how heavy the game is.. any recomendations on the subject other than &quot;pick mature enough players&quot; ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T11:21:26-07:00","id":268370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=268285#post268285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> being a bit more serious, hows Halloween and Dia de los Muertos treated in wraith.?<br /> also, i was discussing with a friend about how...overkill wraith is (i mean as a pyschological game), and he claimed that not many players would go through wraith concidering how heavy the game is.. any recomendations on the subject other than &quot;pick mature enough players&quot; ?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You'll see a general localized weakening of the Shroud where festivals of the dead are being celebrated, as well as it being a bit easier to top off from your Passions.<br /> <br /> As for the second question, I think the answer I'd give is &quot;consider a lighter storyline&quot;. Yes, Wraith can be intense, which to me is one of its great strengths. But why not try going full Beetlejuice instead, where the Circle is driving unwanted humans out of a favorite haunt. Or do a Ghost Pirate thing on the seas of the Tempest. Or dungeon crawl to your heart's content with some Helldiving. You can even set the parameters of Shadowplay before a session to make sure it doesn't overwhelm the primary action. It's OK. I won't tell the writers who handling that section of the book.<br /> <br /> So, in conclusion: Yes, full bore Dies Irae level Wraith can be as intense as hell. But you don't have to play it that way every time, or even any time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T14:09:11-07:00","id":268523,"title":"","content":"Regarding other Dark Kingdoms; Africa is a <i>massive</i> continent, full of diverse people and many modern nations. Why is Wraith's treatment of Africa content to be a pulp-inspired magical &quot;darkest Africa&quot; jungle full of animal spirits and tribesmen? It's always stuck in my craw a little bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T23:13:33-07:00","id":268827,"title":"","content":"will you update the world wide view on wraith concidering the current events in the world?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T21:28:02-07:00","id":273482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=268827#post268827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">will you update the world wide view on wraith concidering the current events in the world?</div> </div> </div> </div>Part of trying to make Wraith more accessible is, of course, reassessing the world it inhabits. I promise, I'm not going to try to make people think it's still 1997. The Ace of Base flashbacks alone would kill me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T21:30:17-07:00","id":273483,"title":"","content":"A question that specifically pertains to Dark Kingdom of Jade - will there be only one Ability that governs unarmed combat, and will it be called Brawl?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T21:38:52-07:00","id":273485,"title":"","content":"Any new Wraiths NPCs an Factions? (a friend is asking if Robin Williams wouild be an official wraith, i slapped him saying 'Too Soon!') also, any chances you involve Wraiths in the Internet now? im not saying Virtual Adept wraiths, but how now Arcanoi could/would affect computers and websites (Creepypastas anyone?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T12:24:47-07:00","id":274092,"title":"","content":"How would the time of the year affect the Fog? Since it's getting close to Halloween and Dia De Los Muertos, I'm kinda curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T13:14:00-07:00","id":274128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=273485#post273485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any new Wraiths NPCs an Factions? (a friend is asking if Robin Williams wouild be an official wraith, i slapped him saying 'Too Soon!') also, any chances you involve Wraiths in the Internet now? im not saying Virtual Adept wraiths, but how now Arcanoi could/would affect computers and websites (Creepypastas anyone?)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's already in WtO. To begin with the level 2 Inhabit ability, <i>Ride the Electron Highway</i>, enables wraiths to travel along communication networks, even satellites. And the Artificers Guildbook includes further Inhabit powers that affect computers and the like. In fact if I remember correctly one of the sample characters in that book includes a hacker who continues their practice after death.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T09:02:26-07:00","id":277279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=274128#post274128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's already in WtO. To begin with the level 2 Inhabit ability, <i>Ride the Electron Highway</i>, enables wraiths to travel along communication networks, even satellites. And the Artificers Guildbook includes further Inhabit powers that affect computers and the like. In fact if I remember correctly one of the sample characters in that book includes a hacker who continues their practice after death.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, Ghost in the Machine has always been a thing in Wraith.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T14:03:48-07:00","id":279053,"title":"","content":"Welcome back RealDeadGuy! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Since you said you would be willing to answer missed questions. I saw two that Aeoris posted that I was really curious about to, so I will repost like you said here and then a general one of my own:<br /> <br /> &quot;2. How do you represent the power of the mightier servants of oblivion in game? In the fluff of the ancients (Sea of Shadows i believe), it implied that some of the mightier servants of oblivion would be akin to a Methuselah from vampire. Did you have a way of scaling/representing their power? I understand that a true malfean is basically beyond the ability of any group to destroy without some epic gaming, but what about some of their more potent Nephwracks?<br /> <br /> <br /> 3. Are there any special rules for dark steel weapons and armor? We see a little color on them in Orpheus, and I assumed that they would basically follow the same rules for which weapon breaks the other as true jade v soul jade. Will we see dark steel given additional rules or will it basically be an aggravated damage version of a standard weapon?&quot;<br /> <br /> And I was curious if the writers you went with were all people you worked with before or any new ones that you gave a chance to that had no prior experience or work history, like you once said you were given a chance? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Wishing you all the best! Happy for your return!<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> Khaleesi","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1343-khaleesi","name":"Khaleesi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T19:29:12-07:00","id":279307,"title":"","content":"How much attention is being put towards crossover content in Wraith20? Special focus in my question towards the Fallen.<br /> <br /> Will we ever learn more about the Fishers? While I hold out dim hope for an eventual Dark Ages: Wraith, I'd love to know more about them in the meantime. (I'm mostly just curious about how the Albigensian Crusade affected the Underworld).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T09:27:07-07:00","id":279770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=268049#post268049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And for the record, folks:<br /> <br /> Most of my answers are serious.<br /> <br /> A few...not so much.<br /> <br /> And sometimes when I don't answer a question, it's because I can't give you the answer...yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dear Mr. RealDeadguy,<br /> <br /> When you can't give an answer yet (of course that would be to serious questions), would you please let us know you can't rather than just not respond? That way, we do not feel ignored, which I know you don't mean to do, but if you say you can't answer a particular question, at least we feel heard.<br /> <br /> Thank you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1343-khaleesi","name":"Khaleesi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T15:13:04-07:00","id":285450,"title":"","content":"Dear RealDeadguy<br /> <br /> So Charon and the Deathlords established the Dictum Mortuum to keep the Restless from interfering overmuch with the Quick. Considering the amount of antagonistic beings on the Quick's side of the Shroud, where their any laws or decrees created to protect the Restless from being tormented or enslaved through necromantic magic? I realize that its likely beyond the scope of Wraith20, but I have always quietly wondered why the Hierarchy hasn't just lowered the boom on the Giovanni or other necromancers, or at least tried to engage them on some level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1525-one-thousand-years","name":"One Thousand Years","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1525_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-24T19:17:06-07:00","id":291745,"title":"","content":"Ello realdeadguy!, hows a going!.<br /> <br /> i recently got the V20 and i noticed that a lot of concepts from the splatterbooks and other sources are inside the core book (such as the lesser bloodlines and such), with that in mind i wanted to know. Will you add elements of the other books in the main Wraith 20 years book, such as Risens?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T21:49:49-07:00","id":294520,"title":"","content":"Hey Crowley,<br /> <br /> That was already answered way back. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> See post: <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primal Flame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=123011#post123011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, RealDeadGuy, enough word count for specters and risen? I'm talking specifically about material from the Dark Reflections and The Risen books.</div> </div> </div> </div> and Deadguys reply here:<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealDeadguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/34987-ask-the-deadguy?p=124322#post124322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...<br /> Just put the final touches on the outline of the Spectres chapter. So, yes, that's a thing. Risen I'm still futzing with. As opposed to the Riesen, which are the ghosts of chocolate caramel candies, which will appear in a later supplement.<br /> -Deadguy Out</div> </div> </